    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Warrior Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an online battle where victory depends on your speed and accuracy on the keyboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump up your keystroke skills and prove to everyone who is the real king of comments here! Trolls, memes, text battles - all this in a funny and addictive first-person arcade... well, almost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480540/extras/f358fa6b1e4b9e84dc193c68af0d7322.avif?t=1751051439\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fight meme trolls and prove your opinion in heated online discussions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Accurate and fast typing is the key to victory in each round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Unique enemy avatars - from schoolchildren to internet bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Funny key explosion effects when making mistakes - feel the real keyboard rage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Combos and multipliers for the coolest keyboard warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f BOSS mode \u2014 the final challenge for real pros</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements and leaderboards for the most persistent forum warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is it worth playing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it is a test of your reaction and patience, a challenge for fans of memes and internet debates. Forget about boring shooters \u2014 here your keyboard is a weapon, and laughter and nostalgia are guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to prove that you are a real Keyboard Warrior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press PLAY and break into the hottest internet debate!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Warrior Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run into an online battle where victory depends on your speed and accuracy on the keyboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pump up your keystroke skills and prove to everyone who is the real king of comments here! Trolls, memes, text battles - all this in a funny and addictive first-person arcade... well, almost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480540/extras/f358fa6b1e4b9e84dc193c68af0d7322.avif?t=1751051439\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fight meme trolls and prove your opinion in heated online discussions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Accurate and fast typing is the key to victory in each round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Unique enemy avatars - from schoolchildren to internet bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Funny key explosion effects when making mistakes - feel the real keyboard rage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Combos and multipliers for the coolest keyboard warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f BOSS mode \u2014 the final challenge for real pros</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements and leaderboards for the most persistent forum warriors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is it worth playing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it is a test of your reaction and patience, a challenge for fans of memes and internet debates. Forget about boring shooters \u2014 here your keyboard is a weapon, and laughter and nostalgia are guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to prove that you are a real Keyboard Warrior?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press PLAY and break into the hottest internet debate!</p>",
